				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Echo): Rewrite README with precise architectural overview and usage guide\n\nReplace the marketing-style headline and generic descriptions with a technically accurate summary of Echo's work-stealing scheduler, priority-based task execution, and integration with the Mountain backend and ActionEffect pattern.\n\nRefactor the features list to highlight the lock-free crossbeam-deque implementation, graceful shutdown via Drop guards, and the decoupled Queue abstraction. Update code examples to reflect the fluent Builder API and correct link targets for documentation and contribution guides. Standardize casing for Echo, Mountain, and other component names to adhere to project PascalCase conventions.",
